     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem nmdp-specimen-type</b></p><a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type\"> </a><a name=\"hcnmdp-specimen-type\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://terminology.nmdp.org/codesystem/specimen-type</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">blood-acd<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-blood-acd\"> </a></td><td>Blood (ACD)</td><td>Whole blood collected in an ACD (Acid Citrate Dextrose) anticoagulant tube.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">blood-edta<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-blood-edta\"> </a></td><td>Blood (EDTA)</td><td>Whole blood collected in an EDTA anticoagulant tube.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">blood-no-anticoagulant<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-blood-no-anticoagulant\"> </a></td><td>Blood (No Anticoagulant)</td><td>Whole blood collected without anticoagulant.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">blood-sodium-heparin<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-blood-sodium-heparin\"> </a></td><td>Blood (Sodium Heparin)</td><td>Whole blood collected in a sodium heparin anticoagulant tube.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">buccal-swab<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-buccal-swab\"> </a></td><td>Buccal Swab</td><td>Buccal epithelial cells collected via oral swab.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">hair-root<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-hair-root\"> </a></td><td>Hair Root</td><td>Hair follicle root sample for DNA extraction.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">saliva<a name=\"nmdp-specimen-type-saliva\"> </a></td><td>Saliva</td><td>Saliva sample for DNA extraction.</td></tr></table></div>"
